  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Advancing the Women Peace and Security Agenda in Sudan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to strengthen Sudanese women&#x2019;s leadership and participation in peace processes by improving UN system coordination and amplifying the voices of women inside Sudan.

Outcomes
1.	Outcome 1: UN coordination on the WPS agenda strengthened, with improved joint planning, analysis, and partnerships.
2.	Outcome 2: Women&#x2019;s local peacebuilding efforts supported through mapping, analysis, and inclusive consultations in conflict-affected areas.
3.	Outcome 3: Women&#x2019;s meaningful participation in peace processes increased through tailored capacity-building, mentoring, and support for women-led initiatives.</narrative>
  </description>
